P1 said "PARTIAL: T3/T5/T6 open", P2 said "HALTED", and P3.T3 said "BLOCKED ON AN
EGRESS-POLICY DECISION" — all three false as of the tasks below them, which are
complete and carry their own evidence. History is kept (each header is marked
superseded rather than erased), but the headline now matches the body.

The pattern is the plan's own subject: an artifact whose advertised state no longer
matches its actual state. It was worth naming, not just fixing, because the same
shape produced the earlier P2.T1 scope error.
